{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105443","id":2461902971,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Svah7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105443","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105443.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105443.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105443","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105443/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105443/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105443/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/617029278f795e40c27f2d43873c30724431f47f","number":105443,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rename GraphEdit connection getter methods","user":{"login":"dawdle-deer","id":29020074,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDIwMDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29020074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer","html_url":"https://github.com/dawdle-deer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The new method `_get_connection_list_from_node` is named with the keyword `from`. `GraphEdit` already uses the keyword `from` to distinguish whether a connection is `from` or `to` a node or port, so this keyword incorrectly implies that the method returns a list of all connections `from` a given node (instead of returning all connections on the node, regardless of direction).\r\n\r\nAdditionally, `_get_connection_list` and `_get_connection_list_from_node` refer to the list of connections as `connection_list`, which is inconsistent with other methods such as `_get_connections_intersecting_with_rect`, `set_connections`, `clear_connections`, and `get_connections_description` that simply use `connections`.\r\n\r\nThis change resolves both linguistic issues by renaming `_get_connection_list` to `_get_connections` and `_get_connection_list_from_node` to `_get_connections_by_node`.\r\n\r\nRenaming `_get_connection_list` breaks compatibility with Godot 4.4","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"